      "alt": "Starterkit STKa8MPxS",
      "text": "<h1>SMARC Evaluation kit based on TQMa8MPxS</h1>\n<p>Evaluation kit based on the minimodule TQMa8MPxS, which is based on the i.MX 8M Plus processor an Arm® Cortex®-A53 from NXP. The integrated graphics controller with GPU and hardware acceleration for video encoding and decoding supports applications with high requirements for displaying complex graphics.The starter kit has several interfaces that allow an uncomplicated implementation of various applications.</p>",
